    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "系统的相对稳定性也可以根据每对复数根的相对阻尼系数 ζ 来定义，从而根据响应速度和超调量（而非调节时间）来表征。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The relative stability of a system can also be defined in terms of the relative damping coefficients ζ of each complex root pair and, therefore, in terms of the speed of response and overshoot instead of settling time.",
